    "end": 14.94,
    "transcript": "Hey, Tom."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 14.94,
    "end": 130.4,
    "transcript": "Uh, good."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 130.4,
    "end": 131.4,
    "transcript": "Pretty good."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 131.4,
    "end": 134.9,
    "transcript": "I have these, uh, script revisions almost done on the deodorant ad."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 134.9,
    "end": 135.9,
    "transcript": "Oh, nice."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 135.9,
    "end": 136.9,
    "transcript": "Nice."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 136.9,
    "end": 143.08,
    "transcript": "Um, yeah, so I actually wanted to just talk to you about one thing."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 143.08,
    "end": 146.68,
    "transcript": "When you say LOL, I can see you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 146.68,
    "end": 147.68,
    "transcript": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 147.68,
    "end": 150.64,
    "transcript": "Uh, I, I can see you as well."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 150.64,
    "end": 157.44,
    "transcript": "I mean, but I don't say LOL, and you're always like, L-M-F-A-O, Raffle, Rolf."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 157.44,
    "end": 161.94,
    "transcript": "Why would you say that if I can see you, you know?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 161.94,
    "end": 165.66,
    "transcript": "Um, I'm sorry."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 165.66,
    "end": 169.84,
    "transcript": "I thought this was like, uh, like a real thing, you know?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 169.84,
    "end": 171.64,
    "transcript": "So I was like a little bit nervous."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 171.64,
    "end": 177.36,
    "transcript": "I mean, I'm serious about the L-M-F-A-Os and like more the Rolfs."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 177.36,
    "end": 178.36,
    "transcript": "Uh-huh."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 178.36,
    "end": 179.36,
    "transcript": "So..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 179.36,
    "end": 182.32,
    "transcript": "Um, you know, it's just an expression."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 182.32,
    "end": 183.82,
    "transcript": "I never say LOL."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 183.82,
    "end": 184.82,
    "transcript": "It's..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 184.82,
    "end": 186.48,
    "transcript": "Are you just like staring at me all day?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 186.48,
    "end": 187.48,
    "transcript": "Don't..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 187.48,
    "end": 188.48,
    "transcript": "You know, you have like a business to run."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 188.48,
    "end": 189.32,
    "transcript": "Look."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 189.32,
    "end": 191.08,
    "transcript": "Just be honest with me about it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 191.08,
    "end": 195.56,
    "transcript": "I just don't want to go on my whole life thinking that, you know, my G-chats are funny when"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 195.56,
    "end": 196.56,
    "transcript": "they're not."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 196.56,
    "end": 201.2,
    "transcript": "Like, just tell me the truth so I can grow and like get better at it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 201.2,
    "end": 202.2,
    "transcript": "Dude."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 202.2,
    "end": 203.2,
    "transcript": "Amy, like, what?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 203.2,
    "end": 207.56,
    "transcript": "I should, should I like give you more constructive feedback on your G-chats?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 207.56,
    "end": 208.56,
    "transcript": "What are we like..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 208.56,
    "end": 209.56,
    "transcript": "Whatever."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 209.56,
    "end": 212.14,
    "transcript": "I just wanted to know why you were doing this."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 212.14,
    "end": 213.5,
    "transcript": "Doing this?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 213.5,
    "end": 215.08,
    "transcript": "Why I'm not LOL-ing?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 215.08,
    "end": 216.08,
    "transcript": "No."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 216.08,
    "end": 218.62,
    "transcript": "Why you're telling lies all day."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 219.32,
    "end": 220.62,
    "transcript": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 220.62,
    "end": 221.62,
    "transcript": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 221.62,
    "end": 222.62,
    "transcript": "I was trying to be nice, you know?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 222.62,
    "end": 225.0,
    "transcript": "I mean, you said BRB and then you sat right there."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 225.0,
    "end": 231.08,
    "transcript": "I was BRB-ing from your like never-ending G-chat and I had to make a personal call."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 231.08,
    "end": 235.16,
    "transcript": "Like, why are you taking so many personal calls at the office?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 235.16,
    "end": 238.56,
    "transcript": "That was literally the first personal call I have taken since working here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 238.56,
    "end": 239.56,
    "transcript": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 239.56,
    "end": 241.56,
    "transcript": "Probably because no one would ever call you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 241.56,
    "end": 242.56,
    "transcript": "Okay?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 242.56,
    "end": 244.48,
    "transcript": "You don't even know my outside of work personality."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 244.48,
    "end": 245.56,
    "transcript": "It's very fun."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 245.56,
    "end": 246.56,
    "transcript": "It's fine."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 246.56,
    "end": 247.56,
    "transcript": "Look."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00006",
    "start": 247.56,
